  "title": "Exact Algebraic Degree of Complete Raw Finite-Field Inversion",
  "batch_label": "64",
  "kind": "result-note",
  "original_status": "unresolved",
  "scope": "For every integer n >= 3 and every irreducible polynomial p in F_2[t] of degree n, using the associated polynomial reference basis and the complete raw Boolean extension on all matrices P (including singular P), the map f_raw(P,u) = adj(P) J_n(Pu) has algebraic degree exactly 3(n-1). This statement does not assert the unresolved equality L_ANF^joint(f_raw) = n.",
